---
import Email from '../Email.astro';
---

<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Legal notice</h1>
<p class="mt-6">Information pursuant to § 5 DDG</p>
<address class="mt-2 not-italic">kossov.it<br>Rosental 7<br>80331 Munich<br>Germany</address>
<p class="mt-4">Email: <Email class="text-brand-blue-strong underline" /></p>

<h2 id="privacy-policy" class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-10 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy</h2>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>

<h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Controller</h3>
<p class="mt-2">kossov.it, address and email see above.</p>

<h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Hosting</h3>
<p class="mt-2">This website is served via GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., USA). When you visit it, GitHub processes technically necessary data such as your IP address, date, time and the page requested, in order to deliver the website and protect it against abuse (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). For transfers to the USA, GitHub relies on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework and standard contractual clauses.</p>

<h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">No cookies, no tracking</h3>
<p class="mt-2">We use no cookies and no analytics or advertising services. If you pick a language in the menu, your browser stores only that choice locally (local storage), so the site opens in your language next time (§ 25(2) no. 2 TDDDG). It is never sent to us. Fonts and all content are loaded directly from this website.</p>

<h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Contact</h3>
<p class="mt-2">The contact form does not send anything to us. It only opens your email app. If you write to us, we process your details solely to handle your enquiry (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR) and delete them once they are no longer needed and no legal retention obligations apply.</p>

<h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-ink">Your rights</h3>
<p class="mt-2">You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection (Art. 15–21 GDPR). Just write to <Email class="text-brand-blue-strong underline" />. You may also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority, for example the Bavarian Data Protection Authority (BayLDA).</p>
